docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/R54.md:40:4. Audit `verification/surfacing.rs` for the stale-label discipline: confirm `classify` is exhaustive on `VerificationStatus`, confirm the debug-assertions invariant against stale-in-trusted, confirm the ranker hard precondition excludes non-`Verified` memories from `trusted`, confirm `label_reason` references the verifier's structured reason payload.
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/R54.md:41:5. Audit `verification/incremental.rs` for the no-full-rescan guarantee: confirm `on_graph_delta` walks only memories citing changed files/symbols, confirm the counting test seam from T51, confirm the bounded work budget re-enqueues overflow rather than stalling, confirm `last_verified_graph_snapshot_id` advances on success.
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/R54.md:42:6. Audit `verification/expiry.rs` for spec §Verification Engine "time-bound memory has expired": confirm `MarkExpired` proposal emission, idempotence on re-run, and routing through T39 (no direct writes).
