docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T48.md:41:5. In `verification/existence.rs`, implement `FileExistenceCheck`, `SymbolExistenceCheck`, `DocSectionExistenceCheck`, `TestExistenceCheck`. Each consumes a `MemoryEvidence` reference and the current graph snapshot, returns a `VerificationVerdict { status, reason: String }`. `Verified` when the identity resolves; `Invalidated` (file/symbol deletion) or `Stale` (graph snapshot is older than the evidence's anchor timestamp) otherwise. Test evidence resolves through the existing test-id index from Phase 1.
