docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T65.md:12:This task creates the canonical metrics module that collects every assistant-usefulness signal required by spec §Phase 9. Without a single module owning these signals, downstream tasks (T66 benchmark fixtures, T67 MCP surface, T68 CLI report, T69 regression tests) would each invent their own definitions and diverge. The module turns the event log + memory access history + workflow outcomes into the nine required signals named in spec §Phase 9: tool calls per successful task, irrelevant files opened per task, relevant anchor recall, memory inclusion precision, memory later-used rate, stale memory surfaced rate, contradiction missed rate, tests recommended versus tests needed, and workflow success after first plan.
