docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:1:# T23 — Phase 3 — Memory graph CRUD + verification status transitions + idempotent writes
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:7:**Spec anchor:** [§Memory Graph](../../2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md#4-memory-graph)
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:18:> "Memory links should be first-class records … verification status."
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:36:2. Define the create API: `pub fn MemoryStore::create(&self, draft: MemoryDraft, idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey) -> Result<MemoryRecord, MemoryStoreError>`. `MemoryDraft` is `MemoryRecord` minus `memory_id`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `usefulness_score`, `verification_status` (initial status is always `Unverified`). On insert, emit `MemoryCreated` event with payload `{ memory_id, class, stream, scope, idempotency_key }`. Insert evidence rows from `draft.initial_evidence`.
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:44:5. Define the update API: `pub fn update(&self, memory_id, patch: MemoryPatch, evidence: Option<MemoryEvidence>, idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey) -> Result<MemoryRecord, MemoryStoreError>`. `MemoryPatch` is the set of optional updatable fields (content, confidence, freshness_policy, validity_conditions, invalidation_triggers, scope) but NOT `verification_status` (use `transition_status`) and NOT `memory_id` (immutable). Emit `MemoryUpdated` event.
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:45:6. Define the delete API: `pub fn delete(&self, memory_id, reason: &str) -> Result<(), MemoryStoreError>`. Delete is soft: set `verification_status = Invalidated` and write a tombstone row; the original record is kept for replay. Emit `MemoryInvalidated` event.
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:46:7. In `memory_graph/transitions.rs`, define the verification state machine: `pub fn transition_status(store: &MemoryStore, memory_id: MemoryId, to: VerificationStatus, reason: &str, evidence: Option<MemoryEvidence>) -> Result<MemoryRecord, MemoryTransitionError>`. Allowed transitions per spec:
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:47:   - `Unverified → InReview` (verification job started)
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:48:   - `Unverified → Verified` (deterministic verification passed)
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:51:   - `Verified → Stale` (file changed since verification)
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:56:   - `Stale → Verified` (re-verification passed; evidence updated)
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:57:   - `Stale → Invalidated` (re-verification failed and not recoverable)
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T23.md:88:- [ ] Every verification command passes from repo root.
