+- Created shared hardening fixtures in `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/hardening/support.rs`
+- Updated `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/hardening/mod.rs` to register the hardening test modules and removed a stale missing module declaration that blocked `--lib` test compilation.
+- Updated `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/reader.rs` to emit observable `corruption` / `recovery` tracing events for hash mismatches, invalid event kinds, decode failures, spill hash mismatches, and missing spilled payload rows.
+- Updated `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/query.rs` with an event-id-bearing payload decode error.
+- Updated `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/compaction.rs` to preserve snapshot-version errors as `BootstrapError::FormatVersionUnsupported` and log recovery / dangling-reference signals.
+- Updated `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/store.rs` to log event-store open with SQLite recovery enabled.
+- Updated `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/hardening/concurrency_tests.rs` and `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/hardening/partial_index_tests.rs` for compile compatibility with the registered hardening test module.
+- Updated `extension/bin/lattice` from `daemon/target/release/lattice`.
+
